ins the looks on their faces  tell me that these kids aren't ready to  face the horrifying array of mythical  beasts that await them not only does a  huge dragon crash land in the stadium  peter saffron also stated that we'll be  seeing several other magic monsters and  fury of the gods such as minotaurs  harpies manticores and even mega  unicorns as seen towards the end of the  trailer and it can't be a coincidence  that those matte black unicorns are the  same shade as hespera's apple when  anthea ignites the symbols on her hands  they form three swirling circles on her  palms that begin to spin along with the  platform that she hyspera calypso and  freddie are standing on in the final  moment of the trailer shazam throws a  truck at the dragon in the background  there's a marquee that reads volchy an  homage to lucio fultry the godfather of  gore who was like sandberg a horror  director if you check out shazam's suit  here however most of the left side has  been burned to a crisp which appears to  have happened when his suit caught on  fire in a scene shown at the beginning  of the trailer seeing as this dragon  breathes blue flames i wouldn't be  surprised if in the final cut the flames  that sin shazam are blue and mystical  follow me on instagram and twitter  whitney puppy follow new rockstar  subscribe to new rockstars for more  announce with everything you love and  thanks for watching bye  [Music]  you

